@startuml
title UC-H02 - Find a Mobility Hub
autonumber

actor Student
boundary "Hub Search Page" as UI
control "Hub Search Controller" as HC
participant "Location Service" as GPS
database "Hub Database" as DB

Student -> UI: Select Find a Mobility Hub
UI --> Student: Display search and filter options

Student -> UI: Specify location and required services
UI -> HC: searchHubs(criteria)

alt Use current location
    HC -> GPS: getCurrentLocation()

    alt Location available
        GPS --> HC: Current coordinates
    else Location unavailable
        GPS --> HC: Location error
        HC --> UI: Request manual location
        UI --> Student: Ask Student to enter location
        Student -> UI: Enter location manually
        UI -> HC: submitLocation(location)
    end

else Use manually entered location
    HC -> HC: Use specified location
end

HC -> DB: findMatchingHubs(criteria)
DB --> HC: Matching Hub records

alt Matching Hubs found
    HC --> UI: Return matching Hubs
    UI --> Student: Display Hub results

    Student -> UI: Select a Hub
    UI --> Student: Open selected Hub details

else No matching Hubs
    HC --> UI: Return empty result
    UI --> Student: Display no-results message
    Student -> UI: Change location or search range
    UI -> HC: Search again with updated criteria
    HC -> DB: findMatchingHubs(updatedCriteria)
    DB --> HC: Updated results
    HC --> UI: Return updated results
    UI --> Student: Display updated results
end

@enduml